<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Course Approval Notification</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f4f9;
      color: #333;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background: white;
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0px 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .logo {
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .logo span {
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    .black {
      color: black;
    }
    .purple {
      color: #6b46c1;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 22px;
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    p {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .cta-button {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #6b46c1;
      color: white;
      padding: 12px 20px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
    .cta-button:hover {
      background-color: #5a3aa9;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #666;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <!-- EduVerse Logo -->
    <div class="logo">
      <span class="black">E</span><span class="purple">duverse</span>
    </div>

    <h1>Course Approval Notification</h1>

    <p>Dear <%= providerName %>,</p>

    <p>We are pleased to inform you that your course titled "<%= courseTitle %>" has been approved and is now live on <strong>EduVerse</strong>. Congratulations on this milestone!</p>

    <p>Our team has thoroughly reviewed your course, and we believe it will be a valuable addition to our learning community. Thank you for your dedication and effort in creating this course.</p>

    <p>If you have any questions or need support, feel free to reach out to us.</p>

    <p>Click below to view and manage your course:</p>

    <a href="<%= courseLink %>" class="cta-button">View Your Course</a>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>Best Regards,</p>
      <p><strong>EduVerse Team</strong></p>
      <p><a href="mailto:support@eduverse.com" style="color: #6b46c1;">support@eduverse.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
